WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.380
«I don't have time.» Look at your week right now.

2
00:00:03.430 --> 00:00:05.970
Monday three messages. Tuesday two.

3
00:00:06.020 --> 00:00:09.010
Wednesday you forget. Thursday you don't know who to restart from.

4
00:00:09.060 --> 00:00:12.350
Friday you've stopped. With RelAI: fifteen minutes a day.

5
00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:14.190
Twenty-one new contacts a week.

6
00:00:14.240 --> 00:00:15.840
Every follow-up on the right day.

7
00:00:15.890 --> 00:00:17.360
Nobody forgotten.

8
00:00:17.410 --> 00:00:21.460
You don't need an hour. You need to not skip the day.
